          "paragraphId": "shiguochunqiu-v038-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "9ba619be512bfca13f21a4a4cdd422ffd8ad96344f02228894b8b6dd3a5a1a74",
          "excerpt": "昭儀李氏，名舜弦，梓州人。酷有辭藻，後主立爲昭儀，世所稱李舜弦夫人也。"
        }
      ],
